<title>USA: ITT Corp may issue $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>ITT Corp may issue $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp is expected to issue $250 million in seven-year notes on Tuesday, market sources said.</p>
<p>The Baa1/BBB rated issue will be non-callable and price talk is in the range of 68 to 70 basis points, sources added.</p>
<p>-- Caryn Trokie 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
